  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups warm water",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "0.25 cup raw honey",
    "3.5 cups whole wheat flour",
    "0.25 cup flaxseed meal",
    "0.25 cup vital wheat gluten",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "1.5 tablespoons dry milk powder",
    "2 teaspoons active dry yeast"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place warm water, butter, honey, whole wheat flour, flaxseed meal, vital wheat gluten, salt, dry milk, and yeast in a bread machine in the order listed. Run a basic wheat bread cycle, but adjust the cook timer to cut baking time down by 25 to 30 minutes. I time the bread and take it out when I see that it is not yet brown. If you like a crusty bread you may let it cook the entire time.",
